cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Vidura, please cite it as below."
title: "Vidura: IPO X-Ray for Indian retail investors"
abstract: >-
  A local web app that reads an Indian IPO offer document (RHP, DRHP or prospectus) and
  produces a cited fact sheet, red flags, plain-English risk factors, a risk level with
  reasons, comparisons and a chat whose numbers are checked against the document.
  Open-weight models only; not investment advice.
type: software
authors:
